IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `lpula-practice`
IMPORT `lpula-costs`

-- Legal Profession Uniform Law Application Act 2022 (WA), ss 3, 132-134, 137, 140, 141, 143, 149, 151, 299 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_legal-profession-uniform-law-application-act-2022.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Scenario facts used (workbench scenarios/au/wa/cradle-to-grave-daniel/facts.json): Daniel born 1996-04-09; d023 on 2019-12-10
-- ("Graduates JD; Practical Legal Training", aged 23); d031 on 2020-08-24 ("Admitted by the Supreme Court; a practising
-- certificate", aged 24); d038 on 2029-03-04 (acts in an arbitration under a conditional costs agreement with a 25% uplift, aged
-- 32). The scenario gives no date for completing practical legal training; the fixtures take the d023 date. Renewal periods,
-- determination dates and amounts below are HYPOTHETICAL inputs (the Act leaves them to regulations or to the Committee).

§ `Fixtures`

`Daniel's arbitration under a compliant conditional costs agreement` MEANS `Costs matter` WITH
    `an applicable costs determination exists` IS TRUE
    `there is a costs agreement` IS TRUE
    `the agreement complies with Uniform Law Part 4.3 Division 4` IS TRUE
    `Legal Aid Commission Act s 14 applies` IS FALSE
    `a court found the determination inadequate for unusual difficulty, complexity or importance` IS FALSE

`the same agreement if it does not comply with the Law` MEANS `Costs matter` WITH
    `an applicable costs determination exists` IS TRUE
    `there is a costs agreement` IS TRUE
    `the agreement complies with Uniform Law Part 4.3 Division 4` IS FALSE
    `Legal Aid Commission Act s 14 applies` IS FALSE
    `a court found the determination inadequate for unusual difficulty, complexity or importance` IS FALSE

`the arbitration where a court finds the determination inadequate` MEANS `Costs matter` WITH
    `an applicable costs determination exists` IS TRUE
    `there is a costs agreement` IS FALSE
    `the agreement complies with Uniform Law Part 4.3 Division 4` IS FALSE
    `Legal Aid Commission Act s 14 applies` IS FALSE
    `a court found the determination inadequate for unusual difficulty, complexity or importance` IS TRUE

`work no determination covers` MEANS `Costs matter` WITH
    `an applicable costs determination exists` IS FALSE
    `there is a costs agreement` IS FALSE
    `the agreement complies with Uniform Law Part 4.3 Division 4` IS FALSE
    `Legal Aid Commission Act s 14 applies` IS FALSE
    `a court found the determination inadequate for unusual difficulty, complexity or importance` IS FALSE

§ `ss 3, 132-134 -- what a determination may cover (the arbitration fork)`

#ASSERT NOT `the work is contentious business` `the Supreme Court` TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT `a costs determination may cover the work` `an arbitrator` FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a costs determination may cover the work` `an arbitrator` FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `a costs determination may cover the work` `an arbitrator` FALSE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `a costs determination may cover the work` `the Federal Court of Australia` FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `a costs determination may cover the work` `no proceedings` FALSE FALSE FALSE

§ `ss 137, 140, 299 -- force and review`

#ASSERT `the determination comes into force on` 20290301 TRUE 20290401 EQUALS 20290401

#ASSERT `the first s 137 review is overdue` 20210301 FALSE 20230301
#ASSERT NOT `the first s 137 review is overdue` 20210301 FALSE 20230228

§ `s 141 -- what governs the costs of d038`

#ASSERT NOT `the costs determination governs the costs` `Daniel's arbitration under a compliant conditional costs agreement`
#ASSERT `the costs determination governs the costs` `the same agreement if it does not comply with the Law`
#ASSERT NOT `the costs determination governs the costs` `the arbitration where a court finds the determination inadequate`
#ASSERT NOT `the costs determination governs the costs` `work no determination covers`

#ASSERT `the costs agreement displaces the determination` `Daniel's arbitration under a compliant conditional costs agreement`

§ `s 143 -- disclosure`

#ASSERT `the law practice breached s 143` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the law practice breached s 143` TRUE TRUE

§ `ss 149, 151 -- after a costs assessment`

#ASSERT `the review application is in time` 20290301 20290329
#ASSERT NOT `the review application is in time` 20290301 20290330
#ASSERT `the review application is in time` 20280210 20280309

#ASSERT `the excess recoverable as a debt` 12000 10000 EQUALS 2000

